ui-use-the-split-button-color-that-matches-the-page-emphasis-filled-for-the-highest-emphasis = Use the split button color that matches the page emphasis: filled for the highest emphasis, tonal for medium emphasis, elevated when the button sits on imagery, and outlined on plain surfaces.

