ui-each-button-in-the-split-button-needs-a-minimum-target-area-of-48-48dp-extra-small-and-sma = Each button in the split button needs a minimum target area of 48 × 48dp. Extra small and small split buttons are shorter than 48dp, so the target areas around them need to be at least 48dp tall.

